<section class="case-outcome"><div><p class="eyebrow">The practical output</p><h2>A presentation sequence that supports both general and specialist conversations.</h2></div><p>This is self-initiated work, created to demonstrate our <a href="/services/information-design/">information design</a> approach to structure and mechanism. Simpler views can stand alone; the causal model is available when a guided, deeper discussion is needed.</p></section>

